meta {
  name: Widget VTON (Virtual Try-On Gateway)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/widget/vton
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Manikan-Key: {{apiKey}}
  Origin: http://localhost:3000
}

body:multipart-form {
  human_image: @file(/path/to/person_photo.jpg)
  product_id: {{productId}}
}

docs {
  ## POST /api/widget/vton

  **Public-key Virtual Try-On Gateway.** The widget endpoint for the
  2D Virtual Try-On service. Gated by `X-Manikan-Key` and requires
  a `VTON_2D` service subscription.

  ### Authentication
  - `X-Manikan-Key` header with a retailer widget API key
  - The key must have an active `VTON_2D` subscription

  ### Form Fields
  | Field       | Type | Required | Constraints                    |
  |-------------|------|----------|--------------------------------|
  | human_image | File | ✅       | JPEG/PNG, non-empty, max 5MB   |
  | product_id  | str  | ✅       | Must belong to this retailer   |

  ### Processing
  This endpoint internally calls `/api/vton/2d` (the service-key-protected
  internal proxy) with the VTON_2D service key and forwards the result.

  ### Success (200)
  Returns the **generated try-on image** as a binary stream:
  ```
  Content-Type: image/jpeg  (or image/png)
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  | Status | Description                                     |
  |--------|-------------------------------------------------|
  | 400    | Invalid image or missing product_id             |
  | 401    | Missing API key                                 |
  | 403    | Key not activated / Origin not in allowlist     |
  | 404    | Product not found                               |
  | 429    | VTON quota exhausted                            |
  | 503    | VTON_2D_SERVICE_KEY not configured              |
  | 502    | Upstream VTON service unreachable               |
}
